# Supply current server-side signed actor headers; never copy production credentials here.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:15100
@uploadId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@profileId = demo-owner
@internalKey = replace-locally
@timestamp = replace-locally
@signature = replace-locally

### Transcript and audio availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/coach-checkins/{{uploadId}}/evidence?profileId={{profileId}}
X-Internal-Api-Key: {{internalKey}}
X-Agent-Actor: {{profileId}}
X-Agent-Role: Owner
X-Agent-Timestamp: {{timestamp}}
X-Agent-Signature: {{signature}}

### Manually attach or replace audio on a completed call (Owner attests it is correct)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/coach-checkins/{{uploadId}}/audio?profileId={{profileId}}
Content-Type: audio/mp4
X-Internal-Api-Key: {{internalKey}}
X-Agent-Actor: {{profileId}}
X-Agent-Role: Owner
X-Agent-Timestamp: {{timestamp}}
X-Agent-Signature: {{signature}}

< ./chosen-recording.m4a

### Original recording range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/coach-checkins/{{uploadId}}/audio?profileId={{profileId}}
Range: bytes=0-1023
X-Internal-Api-Key: {{internalKey}}
X-Agent-Actor: {{profileId}}
X-Agent-Role: Owner
X-Agent-Timestamp: {{timestamp}}
X-Agent-Signature: {{signature}}

### Delete only a disposable completed/failed recording
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/coach-checkins/{{uploadId}}/audio?profileId={{profileId}}
X-Internal-Api-Key: {{internalKey}}
X-Agent-Actor: {{profileId}}
X-Agent-Role: Owner
X-Agent-Timestamp: {{timestamp}}
X-Agent-Signature: {{signature}}
